			"notes": "Fabric 1.21.5\nv1.1.3\n\n- Added some failsafes for Beach Ball in the case that it does hit a wall\n\n- Added render blocking\n    - /sbc render [entity] which toggles that entity rendering\n        - BlockDisplay, ArmorStand, Player, FallingBlock\n\n- Added Sea Lumie Helpers\n    - /sbc config set lumie-hitboxes [true/false]\n        - Changes sea pickles to be 1x1x1\n        - Removes hitbox for Kelp and Seagrass\n\n    - /sbc config set lumie-hideblocks [true/false]\n        - Hides Kelp and Seagrass\n- Added hide leaves\n    - /sbc config set hide-leaves [true/false]\n    - Hides leaves for fig and mangrove trees\n\n- Added sound block\n    - /sbc config set block-blank-hit-sound [true/false]\n    - Blocks i-frame hit sounds (deals no damage like 1.8)\n\n- Increased CPS cap to 50\n\n- Fixed ghost blocking and made it work with insta-mining"
		},
